# Mycosynth Lattice, its three abilities:
# - "All permanents are artifacts in addition to their other types" (layer 4): Bot2's Island is a Land Artifact, Llanowar
#   Elves an artifact creature; cards in hands are no permanents and gain no type.
# - "All cards that aren't on the battlefield, spells, and permanents are colorless" (layer 5, every zone - the ruling):
#   Bot2's Llanowar Elves is green in hand before the Lattice (the positive control) and colorless in hand after it, on the
#   battlefield, and in the graveyard; Bot1's Lightning Bolt is colorless in hand.
# - "Players may spend mana as though it were mana of any color" (CR 609.4b), colorless mana too (the ruling), for every
#   player: Bot2 casts Llanowar Elves ({G}) with an Island's {U}, and Bot1 casts Lightning Bolt ({R}) with Sol Ring's {C}.
#   The costs are unchanged: each spell still has its mana value.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Sol Ring
Mycosynth Lattice
Lightning Bolt
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Llanowar Elves
Island
Island x30

[Actions]
? Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Colors = Green
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
